---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { settings } from '../lib/settings';

const updated = '27 November 2026';
---

<Layout
    title="Legal"
    description={`Privacy policy and terms for ${settings.siteTitle}.`}
>
    <section class="pb-16 pt-10 lg:pb-24 lg:pt-16">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
                <p class="eyebrow mb-3">The small print</p>
                <h1
                    class="text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.035em] text-appGray-700 sm:text-5xl"
                >
                    Legal
                </h1>
                <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-appGray-400">
                    Last updated {updated}
                </p>

                <nav
                    class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-y border-[#EFEBE6] py-4"
                    aria-label="Legal sections"
                >
                    <a
                        href="#privacy"
                        class="rounded-full bg-appGray-100 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-appAccent transition-colors hover:bg-appGray-200"
                    >
                        Privacy policy
                    </a>
                    <a
                        href="#terms"
                        class="rounded-full bg-appGray-100 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-appAccent transition-colors hover:bg-appGray-200"
                    >
                        Terms &amp; conditions
                    </a>
                </nav>

                <div class="recipe-body mt-10">
                    <section id="privacy" class="scroll-mt-24">
                        <h2>Privacy policy</h2>
                        <p>
                            {settings.siteTitle} is a personal recipe blog. This
                            page explains what information is collected when you
                            visit the site and how it is used.
                        </p>

                        <h3>Information we collect</h3>
                        <p>
                            The site does not require an account to read
                            recipes. If you use the contact form, your email
                            app opens with a message addressed to us — nothing
                            is submitted to or stored by this website. If you
                            choose to email us directly, we receive your email
                            address and the contents of your message.
                        </p>

                        <h3>Hosting and analytics</h3>
                        <p>
                            The site is hosted on Vercel and may keep standard
                            server logs (such as IP address, browser type and
                            requested pages) for security and performance.
                            Recipe images may be served from Cloudinary or other
                            image hosts, which can receive standard request
                            information. We do not sell personal information.
                        </p>

                        <h3>Cookies and advertising</h3>
                        <p>
                            This site uses Google AdSense to display advertising.
                            Google and its partners may use cookies, web beacons
                            and similar technologies to serve, measure and
                            personalise ads based on your visits to this and
                            other websites. We do not control these third-party
                            cookies.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            You can learn how Google uses information from sites
                            that use its services in
                            <a
                                href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            >
                                Google&rsquo;s Privacy &amp; Terms
                            </a>
                            , and manage personalised advertising in
                            <a
                                href="https://adssettings.google.com/"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            >
                                Google Ads Settings
                            </a>
                            . Where required by law, a consent prompt is shown
                            before personalised advertising cookies are used.
                            You can also block or delete cookies in your browser
                            settings. The editing area at
                            <a href="/keystatic">/keystatic</a> is used only by
                            the site owner and relies on a GitHub login session.
                        </p>

                        <h3>Your rights</h3>
                        <p>
                            You can ask us to delete any email correspondence we
                            hold about you by writing to
                            <a href={`mailto:${settings.contact.email}`}>
                                {settings.contact.email}
                            </a>.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section id="terms" class="mt-14 scroll-mt-24">
                        <h2>Terms &amp; conditions</h2>
                        <p>
                            By using this website you agree to these terms. They
                            are intentionally short and written in plain
                            language.
                        </p>

                        <h3>Recipes and content</h3>
                        <p>
                            Recipes are provided for personal, non-commercial
                            use. We test recipes carefully, but ovens, ingredients
                            and allergies vary — you are responsible for
                            checking ingredients and cooking food safely. All
                            text and photography remain the property of their
                            respective owners.
                        </p>

                        <h3>No warranty</h3>
                        <p>
                            The site is provided “as is”. We do not guarantee
                            that it will be available without interruption or
                            that every recipe will work exactly as described in
                            your kitchen.
                        </p>

                        <h3>External links</h3>
                        <p>
                            Links to other websites are provided for convenience.
                            We are not responsible for the content or privacy
                            practices of those sites. Advertising is provided by
                            Google AdSense; we do not endorse the products or
                            services shown in those ads.
                        </p>

                        <h3>Changes</h3>
                        <p>
                            We may update these terms from time to time. The
                            date at the top of this page shows when they were
                            last revised.
                        </p>

                        <h3>Contact</h3>
                        <p>
                            Questions about these terms? Email
                            <a href={`mailto:${settings.contact.email}`}>
                                {settings.contact.email}
                            </a>
                            and we will do our best to help.
                        </p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
